    "detailed_description": "Caroline is a young woman who suffers from depression and will have to deal with her biggest fears in a chaotic and dystopian world. On her arduous journey, Caroline must overcome her weaknesses and defeat her own demons. Break through this mysterious world with challenging levels in an enigmatic adventure, help little Caroline in her quest to overcome her losses!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*A 2D plataform game that will challenge your skills as a player.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*A single player experience, an personal adventure on a quest for redemption and overcoming the hardships... or not.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* A unique achievement for those who finish our demo version.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* This project is still under development, follow our facebook page for more information about this game.",
